{"format":"coupole-schema/1","id":"doppler_fronts","taille":[680,300],"titre":{"fr":"Effet Doppler : fronts d'onde","en":"Doppler effect: wavefronts"},"alt":{"fr":"Une source qui se déplace vers la droite émet des fronts d'onde circulaires centrés sur ses positions successives : ils sont resserrés devant elle (longueur d'onde plus courte, décalage vers le bleu) et espacés derrière (décalage vers le rouge).","en":"A source moving to the right emits circular wavefronts centred on its successive positions: they are bunched ahead of it (shorter wavelength, blueshift) and spread out behind (redshift)."},"elements":[{"t":"cercle","c":[370.55,150],"r":21,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[361.1,150],"r":42,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[351.65,150],"r":63,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[342.2,150],"r":84,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[332.75,150],"r":105,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[323.3,150],"r":126,"style":{"trait":"accent2","fond":null,"ep":1.5}},{"t":"cercle","c":[380,150],"r":7,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"accent","ep":1.5}},{"t":"ligne","p":[[390,150],[450,150]],"style":{"trait":"accent","fond":null,"ep":2.5,"fleche":"fin"}},{"t":"texte","p":[600,40],"txt":{"fr":"observateur en face :\nλ plus courte (bleu)","en":"observer ahead:\nshorter λ (blue)"},"taille":12,"ancre":"m","base":"milieu","couleur":"froid"},{"t":"texte","p":[70,40],"txt":{"fr":"observateur derrière :\nλ plus longue (rouge)","en":"observer behind:\nlonger λ (red)"},"taille":12,"ancre":"m","base":"milieu","couleur":"chaud"},{"t":"point","p":[640,150],"r":6,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"froid","ep":1.5}},{"t":"point","p":[30,150],"r":6,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"chaud","ep":1.5}}],"vue":[0.0,0.0,680.0,300.0]}